**Notes on the plan**: implemented as specified. The decoding of literal `+` to space is done before `decodeURIComponent` so `%2B` still yields `+`; `stringifyQuery` uses `encodeURIComponent` (the `%20`/`%2B` inverse). I added two tests beyond the minimum the plan listed — empty-segment skipping (`a=1&&b=2`, `&`) and a `toString` prototype-key case — both implied by the spec.
